From f00531e33419deb124c40eaac60a933a71a7fec7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 16:48:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2724/2728] drm/sun4i: Add A523 HDMI PHY driver

The Allwinner A523/A527/T527 HDMI block embeds an Innosilicon HDMI 2.0
TX PHY at offset 0x10000 from the HDMI controller base. The PHY has a
custom register layout (8-bit registers, separate pre-PLL / post-PLL
blocks and per-channel driver / LDO / current bias controls) that
diverges enough from the existing Synopsys-style variants to warrant a
dedicated file.

Add sun55i_hdmi_phy.c, plumbed in through the existing dw_hdmi phy_ops
mechanism. Wire the new variant into sun8i_hdmi_phy_of_table and stash
the __iomem pointer and region size on sun8i_hdmi_phy for the
byte-wide register accesses that the Innosilicon PHY requires.

Programming sequence, register layout and parameters follow the vendor
BSP (phy_inno.c). BSP has three PHY parameter sets selected by SoC
mark id; A523 uses "version 2", whose 8-bit colour depth entries are
used here (25.2, 27, 37.125, 74.25, 148.5, 297 and 594 MHz). Register
programming was verified against BSP code for all entries.

Notes:
- Pre-PLL divider fields in 0xa4 / 0xa5 / 0xa6 follow BSP layout.
- dw_hdmi MC_PHYRSTZ is toggled before PHY reset, as in BSP.
- Register 0x8004 (relative to PHY base) is set to 0x100, as BSP does
  for all PHY revisions except T527 A/B. It's written only if the PHY
  MMIO region in DT covers it.
- PHY PLL output must match pixel clock produced by CCU, so only TMDS
  rates which are in the table are accepted (within 0.05%).
  sun55i_hdmi_phy_mode_valid() is provided to filter modes.
- Pixel repetition (DBLCLK) is taken into account for TMDS rate.
- phy_force_vendor is added to PHY variant and set for A523, so dw_hdmi
  always uses our phy_ops, regardless of the PHY type reported in
  HDMI_CONFIG2_ID. Other variants leave it false, so H6 / H616 still
  use the internal Synopsys PHY path unchanged.
- rxsense timeout is only a warning, like in BSP.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun55i_hdmi_phy.c | 570 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.h   |   7 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c  |  10 +-
 4 files changed, 587 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun55i_hdmi_phy.c

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile
